@startuml architecture
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title Архитектура приложения Fast Typing Trainer

package "Браузер (Client)" {
    component "HTML/CSS\n(Templates)" as HTML
    component "JavaScript\nModules" as JS {
        [typing-trainer.js]
        [statistics.js]
        [main.js]
    }
}

package "Flask Server" {
    component "app.py" as APP {
        [Routes]
        [Authentication]
        [Session Management]
    }
    component "Templates\n(Jinja2)" as TMPL
}

database "SQLite\n(users.db)" as DB {
    frame "User" {
        [id]
        [username]
        [password_hash]
        [stats (JSON)]
    }
}

cloud "HTTP/AJAX" as HTTP

HTML -down-> JS : использует
JS -right-> HTTP : AJAX запросы\n(save_stats)
HTTP -down-> APP : POST /save_stats\nGET /\nGET /profile\nPOST /login\nPOST /logout\nGET/POST /register
APP -right-> DB : SQLAlchemy\nORM
APP -up-> TMPL : рендеринг
TMPL -up-> HTTP : HTML
HTTP -left-> HTML : страницы

note right of JS
  **Основные функции:**
  • Тренажёр печати
  • Адаптивный алгоритм
  • Статистика (recent + full)
  • Визуальная подсветка
end note

note left of DB
  **Хранение:**
  • Пользователи
  • Хеши паролей
  • JSON-статистика
end note

@enduml
